      "seconds": 25.27,
      "answer": "IVMS, or In-Vehicle Monitoring System, is part of the vehicle telematics solutions offered within the NAVAS ecosystem. It provides core functionalities such as location tracking, trip history, and geofencing. The system can be enhanced with add-ons like ECO for driver behavior monitoring and BI dashboards for business intelligence. \n\nSource: NAVAS CMS User Manual — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
