      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 25.6,
      "answer": "Tracking tokens in the NAVAS platform are part of a consumption-based billing structure. This means that users are billed based on the amount of telematics services they consume, such as tracking vehicles, fuel, drivers, equipment, and staff in real-time.\n\nSource: Sales Procedures 3DS-QMS-PR-09 ver26 (Uganda & Kenya) — this is the documented procedure; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
