      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 25.13,
      "answer": "VEBA is a system within the NAVAS platform that introduces marketplace behaviors such as asset listings, booking approvals, conflict alerts, and payments. It allows asset owners to list their vehicles or equipment, enabling them to earn revenue from idle assets. VEBA also handles booking flows, asset monetization, and ensures that payments are processed only after telematics confirm the asset was used as agreed. Additionally, it includes features like KYC verification, token deduction audits, and commission processing.",
